file tools/fixtures/l/loom_name_scan.sh the new reading -- kinds and scopes off each loom line's first token, three verdicts, scope_evidence beside them
file tools/fixtures/l/loom_name_control.sh 45 legs on planted journals, all three verdicts drawn, five mutations bitten every pass
