status GREEN -- loom_name GREEN on metal with 45 control legs 0 failing; loom_trend and loom_sitting GREEN after the repair; the hot scope DERIVED from the staged paths rather than chosen, and twenty guards over the touched files and living pages read GREEN. The cold pass was still running at send; its standing reds are width_check on glow/ (pheromone's seat, named on the card) and remember_git_nib, which this commit's own nib closes.
recommend keep-going -- the lane's next crux is the mirror reading this one names and declines: whether two scopes measure the same work under two names, which no reading in this tree asks.
